{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10095","headline":"送日本国聘贺使晁巨卿东归 · 包佶","name":"送日本国聘贺使晁巨卿东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上才生下国，东海是西邻。\n九译蕃君使，千年圣主臣。\n野情偏得礼，木性本含真。\n锦帆乘风转，金装照地新。\n孤城开蜃阁，晓日上朱轮。\n早识来朝岁，涂山玉帛均。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}